    "chunk_text": "eos wyrt \u00fee man acantaleuce & o\u00f0rum naman nemne\u00fe by\u00f0 cenned on st\u00e6nigum stowum & on & heo hafa\u00fe leaf swylce wulfes camb, ac hi beo\u00fe mearwran & hwittran & eac ge\u00feufran, & heo Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t man blode hr\u00e6ce & wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s magan sare genim \u00f0as ylcan wyrte acantaleuce, cnuca to Hyt frema\u00f0 wel. Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mig\u00f0an astyrunge genim \u00fear ylcan wyrte swa wosige gecnucude, syle drincan. Heo \u00f0one mig\u00f0an for\u00f0 gel\u00e6de\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 yfele l\u00e6la genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte, wyrc to cly\u00fean, lege to \u00feam sare. Heo hyt afyrme\u00fe. \u00deysse sylfan wyrte syde \u00fe\u00e6ra to\u00fea sar geli\u00f0iga\u00f0 gyf hyne man swa wearmne on \u00feam mu\u00fee Wi\u00f0 hramman genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte s\u00e6d gecnucud, syle drincan on w\u00e6tere. Hyt helpe\u00fe. Se sylfa drenc eac swylce ongean n\u00e6ddrena slite wel frema\u00f0. Eac swylce gyf mon \u00feas wyrte on mannes swyran aheh\u00f0 heo n\u00e6ddran aflyge\u00fe. Beowyrt. \u00d0eos wyrt \u00fee man acanton & o\u00ferum naman beowyrt nemne\u00f0 by\u00fe cenned on wynsumon stowum & Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s inno\u00fees astyrunge & \u00fe\u00e6s mig\u00fean genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte wyrttruman gedrigedne & to Wi\u00fe lungenadle & wi\u00f0 gehwylce yfelu \u00fee on \u00feam inno\u00f0e dere\u00fe \u00f0eos sylfe wyrt wel frema",
